Debes hablar con Maengamiel y contarle tu victoria contra las musarañas.","Habla con Maengamiel","Musarañas expulsadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las botas necesarias para pisotear musarañas pueden encontrarse cerca de las escaleras del Jardín del Festival.\
\
Debes recoger las botas de la caja y arrastrarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues las necesitarás para ahuyentar musarañas.","Has entrado en el jardín. Asegúrate de tener las botas para musarañas asignadas a tu barra de habilidades","¡Las musarañas... están por todas partes! Hay que detenerlas","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond, y las botas para pisotearlas están en tu inventario.\
\
Debes localizar las botas en tu inventario y asignarlas como habilidad. Estas botas pueden usarse para pisotear a las musarañas que infestan el jardín. Maengamiel te ha pedido que derrotes muchas musarañas en el jardín.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","'Me alegra muchísimo que estés aquí. ¡Estas musarañas nos están volviendo absolutamente locos, y ya casi hemos perdido la esperanza! Esperamos que venga mucha gente a ver el jardín, y si trabajamos juntos, creo que podremos evitar que sigan comportándose tan mal.\
\
'Debes entrar al jardín y esperar a que comience la lucha. Soy una jardinera relajada, así que mis expectativas no son altas: solo te pido que expulses muchas musarañas; ¡no me importa cuánto tiempo te tome!\
\
'Buena suerte, ${PLAYER}.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las botas para pisotear musarañas aparecerán en tu inventario. Debes asignarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues es el único ataque que funciona contra las musarañas molestas de Duillond.</rgb>","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! Es un comienzo. Pronto comenzará un nuevo juego; espero que participes también en el siguiente.","Has recogido botas para pisotear musarañas","Los Elfos de Duillond tienen un jardín que debería lucir hermoso para el Festival de Primavera. Lamentablemente, hace poco fue invadido por musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Estas son unas buenas botas para trabajar en el jardín...","Expulsa musarañas molestas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No temas; tienes todo el tiempo que necesites. Solo debes ahuyentar unas cuantas musarañas, y estaré satisfecho.'"},
[11327]={"Esta ronda ha terminado; no terminaste a tiempo","Estas botas están hechas para pisotear musarañas.","'Deberás colocarte en el centro del jardín de abajo si deseas atrapar a las musarañas molestas.'","'¡Este no es momento para holgazanear! Es imperativo derrotar a las musarañas rápidamente. Si no puedes con ellas en el tiempo asignado, no creo que tengas la destreza necesaria para ayudarnos en este esfuerzo.\
\
'Estas musarañas molestas están arruinando el Ethuilwereth, y Maengamiel te pide que pasees como si nada. Yo te pido que demuestres tu valor ahora, ${PLAYER}, y reveles tu verdadera valentía.\
\
'El juego comenzará ahí abajo, en el jardín. Espera allí, y derrota a esas musarañas molestas tan rápido como puedas.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Las botas para pisotear musarañas aparecerán en tu inventario. Debes asignarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues es el único ataque que funciona contra las musarañas molestas de Duillond.</rgb>","Asigna las botas para pisotear musarañas a tu barra de habilidades y espera el ataque","Toma las botas para pisotear musarañas de la caja cercana","'Deberás colocarte en el centro del jardín de abajo si deseas atrapar a todas esas musarañas.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Derrota musarañas antes de que termine la ronda","'Debes derrotar a muchas musarañas durante la ronda. Si termina antes de que acabes, perderás mi desafío.'","Habla con Brangloth","Musarañas expulsadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las botas necesarias para pisotear musarañas pueden encontrarse cerca de las escaleras del Jardín del Festival.\
\
Debes recoger las botas de la caja y arrastrarlas a tu barra de habilidades, pues las necesitarás para ahuyentar musarañas.","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Brangloth insiste en que derrotes muchas musarañas antes de que el evento llegue a su fin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>","Has entrado en el jardín. Asegúrate de tener las botas para musarañas asignadas a tu barra de habilidades","Brangloth está en el Jardín del festival de Duillond.\
\
Debes hablar con Brangloth para contarle lo que sucedió con las musarañas molestas.","¡Las musarañas... están por todas partes! Hay que detenerlas","Has recibido botas para pisotear musarañas; debes asignarlas como habilidad y entrar al jardín","'¡Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}! Has completado tu labor tal como te pedí. Me caes bastante bien, ¿sabes? Espero volver a verte en el futuro, pues creo que siempre habrá trabajo de jardinería que hacer aquí.'","Patea una Musaraña para el jardinero experimentado","Has recogido botas para pisotear musarañas","Los Elfos de Duillond tienen un jardín que debería lucir hermoso para el Festival de Primavera. Lamentablemente, hace poco ha sido invadido por musarañas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","Expulsa musarañas molestas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las musarañas molestas se encuentran en el centro del Jardín del Festival de Duillond.\
\
Debes localizar las botas en tu inventario y asignarlas como habilidad. Estas botas permiten pisotear a las musarañas que infestan el jardín. Cuando lo hayas hecho, espera en el centro del jardín a que aparezcan las musarañas. Brangloth insiste en que derrotes muchas musarañas antes de que el evento termine.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para asignar las botas como habilidad, arrastra el objeto 'Botas de Poder Imaginable' desde tu inventario a tu barra de habilidades.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Las musarañas molestas son inmunes a cualquier otro ataque o maniobra ofensiva.</rgb>"},
[11328]={"'What flawless harathar you have chipped for me! You have an eye for quality. My current apprentice could not have sourced half as impressive a sampling as you. I would ask if you wished to replace him, but you seem the adventuring sort; thus I will simply thank you.'","Return to TBD Ziggurat Mason","Stone Dead","The harathar samples can be found in the TBD of TBD.\
\
A mason named TBD would like to get a closer look at some harathar outcroppings. He has asked you to collect some samples for him.","'If you are wondering what harathar looks like, it is a gleaming, smooth stone of a bright green-blue hue. Most striking, and it stands out on the landscape of the sun-baked Khûd. The wights seem drawn to it, but to what end, I have yet to divine.'","'Hail, wanderer! I did not expect to see travellers so deep into the wastes, but I am pleased to meet you all the same. I thought myself alone with those creeping desert-wights skulking about. I am a mason by trade, you see, and am struggling to reach a most particular group of harathar, as the wights keep blocking my path. I feel at my wit's end. Might you be willing to procure several samples of the stone?'","A mason named TBD has asked for your assistance in collecting several samples of bright green harathar stone from a small mine in TBD Location.","TBD Ziggurat Mason can be found TBD Location.\
\
You have acquired several good samples of harathar. It is time to return to TBD Ziggurat Mason for him to inspect the goods.","Harathar samples collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect samples of harathar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[11329]={"Defeat and collect harnessed stone-biters in the Ironfold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Have you a moment to aid me with another matter, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'I have no doubt you have already noticed, but Járnfast has shaken itself into a bit of ruin. The tunnels of our delving have collapsed, and we have lost access to nearly a third of our richest lodes. If we intend to clear them out, we will have need of many more stone-biters. Stone-biters, you ask? I believe they are known as cave-claws or whisperbacks to other folk, or so I have been told. \
\
'We have long used their knack for burrowing to clear less valuable stones from our mines, but after the tremors, many of them burrowed beyond our reach. They have done similarly before... but not for thought of escaping, mind you! They simply become too excited in their burrowing and just keep digging. Sooner or later, they will burrow back to the surface, but never quite where you lost them!\
\
'If you encounter a stone-biter in a harness of sorts as you travel among the Iron Hills, they are one of ours! You may need to convince them to come along, if you understand my meaning. Ah, but do not worry about being too rough with them. They may as well be made of stone!\
\
'Deliver them to me, and I shall get them back on their feet!'","Stone-biters","Foreman Brumbur can be found among the ruined mines of Járnfast.\
\
You have collected a number of harnessed stone-biters in the Ironfold and should deliver them to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast.","Harnessed stone-biters can be found along the Emyn Engrin in the Ironfold.\
\
Foreman Brumbur has asked you to defeat and collect harnessed stone-biters that have inadvertently burrowed out of Járnfast.","'Hah! It was even more than I thought!\
\
'Do not worry for their well-being, ${PLAYER}. I have found a nice hunk of garnet often rouses them. If they become too excited in their burrowing again, I shall call on you!\
\
'You have my thanks.'","Defeated and collected harnessed stone-biters in the Ironfold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","As they find them useful in clearing less valuable stones, the Dwarves of the Ironfold have begun to share their mines with the cave-claws of the Emyn Engrin.","Deliver the harnessed stone-biters to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast"},
[11330]={"Burl Siempreviva te ha pedido que recuperes provisiones robadas de los orcos de Tharbad.\
\
Tharbad está en el sur de Cardolan.","Provisiones robadas recuperadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Lo has conseguido! Ahora tengo más esperanzas en nuestro futuro.'","La expedición de Burl Siempreviva a Tharbad se ha visto truncada por los orcos que han hecho de las ruinas su hogar.","Las provisiones de Siempreviva","Deberías llevar las provisiones recuperadas a Burl Siempreviva.\
\
Burl se encuentra cerca de Tharbad, en el sur de Cardolan.","Vuelve con Burl Siempreviva","Recupera las provisiones robadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No esperábamos una cálida bienvenida, ni que las cosas fueran fáciles, pero no sabíamos que había orcos por aquí. ¡Por favor, si encuentras alguna de nuestras cajas de provisiones, tráemelas de vuelta!'","'Saludos. Mi nombre es Burl Siempreviva. Mis compañeros y yo viajamos por el Camino Verde e investigamos si merece la pena reconstruir un asentamiento en Cardolan.\
\
'Como se esperaba, en nuestra primera noche aquí en Tharbad fuimos atacados. Las ruinas están llenas de orcos violentos que robaron nuestras provisiones antes de que pudiéramos rechazarlos. Seguramente volvamos a Bree, pero sin nuestras provisiones, el viaje a casa es imposible. Sin embargo, pareces alguien que podría enfrentarse a esos orcos. ¡Si recuperas nuestros suministros te recompensaré!'"},
[11331]={"Exposed crystals can be found throughout the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should hit exposed crystals with Fúni's pick and collect the crystal samples that break off.","Collected samples from exposed crystals (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have collected samples of the crystals found in the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
You should return to Fúni Gem-cutter in Bárgstad.","Talk to Fúni Gem-cutter","'${PLAYER}! It is good to see you again! We Gem-cutters have returned after a long time away, eager to join the Gabil'akkâ. We are not truly warriors, but perhaps we can help in other ways... and if we do not, my wife Amma will never let me hear the end of it!\
\
'She believes the Pit of Stonejaws contains a large number of crystals, and she sent me here to collect some samples. \\qYes, of course!\\q I said to her, but now that we are here I see this area is quite dangerous; see how it swarms with beasts and hobgoblins? Can I ask you to bring me back some crystal samples for examination? You may even borrow my pick!'","'Oh, look at all these beautiful crystals! Hand them over so I may examine them more closely.'\
\
He takes out a bright glass and carefully inspects the crystal samples.\
\
'Hmm. I do not believe these are the same as those the Angmarim corrupt. See how beautiful they are, and how they shine even in the dim light! Our craft is sure to benefit from this cavern's crystals. Thank you for doing the leg-work, ${PLAYER}.'","Fúni Gem-cutter has asked you to collect crystal samples from the Pit of Stonejaws.","Stonejaws Samples","Collect samples from exposed crystals in the Pit of Stonejaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[11332]={"Defeat Anioch","Defeated Krigash","You should return to Zádokh Flint-eye and apprise him of your efforts.","'Careful now, on your journeys.'","Defeated Anioch","You ran out of time...","'Deep within the ancient halls of Stonejaws are riches of lore, in the form of moon-letters. The journey there is not an easy one, however, we need the forgotten letters to learn more about Gundabad's history. Are you willing to take on this task?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest. This quest can be completed with one or two adventurers.</rgb>","Ancient moon-letters are waiting to be uncovered by those who brave the long forgotten halls, deep within the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","'What is this? You have slain a high ranking leader of the Frost-horde? I praise you for your efforts and your talents, ${CLASS}.'","Defeat Anioch or Krigash.","Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye","Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost","Defeat Krigash"},
[11333]={"Ancient moon-letters are waiting to be uncovered by those who brave the long forgotten halls, deep within the Pit of Stonejaws.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Defeat Angmarim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The scout gives you a missive to defeat Angmarim or hobgoblins.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Hobotrasgos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Stonejaws: The Frost-horde","Defeat Angmarim or hobgoblins.","Derrota a los hobotrasgos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Angmarim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
