\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Stonejaws: Leader of the Frost to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Collect moon-letters.","Collect moon-letters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected moon-letters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The scout gives you a missive to collect moon-letters.\
\
